6', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WTH', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['All creatures able to block target creature this turn do so.', "Attacking doesn't cause Ardent Militia to tap.", "Attacking doesn't cause Veteran Cavalier to tap.", 'B', 'Cinder Storm deals 7 damage to target creature or player.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target sorcery spell.', 'Counter target spell.', "Creatures and lands target opponent controls don't untap during his or her next untap step.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Dakmor Plague deals 3 damage to each creature and each player. (This includes your creatures and you.)', "Dakmor Sorceress's power is equal to the number of swamps you control. (Count only the swamps you have in play, including both tapped and untapped swamps.)", 'Destroy all creatures and all lands. (This includes your creatures and lands.)', 'Destroy all creatures with flying. (This includes your creatures.)', 'Destroy all lands. (This includes your lands.)', 'Destroy all tapped creatures. For each creature destroyed this way, you gain 2 life.', 'Destroy target creature. Its owner gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target land or nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. You gain 3 life.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life. (You can't play this card unless you can choose two creatures in play.)", 'Draw four cards, then discard three cards at random from your hand.', 'Draw four cards.', 'Draw three cards. You lose 3 life.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Fire Tempest deals 6 damage to each creature and each player. (This includes your creatures and you.)', 'Flying', 'Flying; haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes into play.)', "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Angel of Light to tap.", "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Archangel to tap.", "Flying\\nGoblin Glider can't block.", 'Flying\\nWhen Abyssal Horror comes into play, target player chooses and discards two cards from his or her hand. (If that player has only one card, he or she discards it.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of Mercy comes into play, you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Dread Reaper comes into play, you lose 5 life.', "Flying\\nWhen Ingenious Thief comes into play, look at target player's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Owl Familiar comes into play, draw a card, then choose and discard a card from your hand.', 'Flying\\nWhen Shrieking Specter attacks, defending player chooses and discards a card from his or her hand.', 'Flying\\nWhen Thunder Dragon comes into play, it deals 3 damage to each creature without flying. (This includes your creatures.)', "For each card in your hand, you gain 2 life. (Don't count this card.)", 'Forestwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player has a forest in play.)', 'G', "Green creatures you control gain forestwalk until end of turn. (They're unblockable as long as defending player has a forest in play.)", 'Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes into play.)', "Hulking Goblin can't block.", "Hulking Ogre can't block.", "If the difference between your life total and target player's life total is 5 or less, exchange life totals with that player.", 'Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player has an island in play.)', "Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to target creature and 3 damage to another target creature. (You can't play this card unless you can choose two creatures in play.)", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target opponent.', "Lone Wolf may deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", "Look at target player's hand and choose a card from it. That player discards that card.", "Look at the top card of target player's library. Put that card back on top of that library or into that player's graveyard.", "Look at the top five cards of target player's library. Put any number of them on the bottom of that library in any order and the rest on top of the library in any order.", 'Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other one on the bottom of your library.', 'Mountainwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player has a mountain in play.)', 'Norwood Archers can block as though it had flying.', 'One or two target creatures gain flying until end of turn.', 'Phantom Warrior is unblockable.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Champion Lancer by creatures.', 'Put target creature card from your graveyard into play.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Put up to three land cards from your hand into play.', 'R', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return two target creatures to their owner's hand. (You can't play this card unless you can choose two creatures in play.)", 'Scorching Spear deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Search your library for a forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a plains, island, swamp, mountain, or forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for any card and put that card into your hand. You lose 3 life.', 'Shuffle any number of creature cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'Spitting Earth deals to target creature damage equal to the number of mountains you control. (Count only the mountains you have in play, including both tapped and untapped mountains.)', 'Squall deals 2 damage to each creature with flying. (This includes your creatures.)', 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player has a swamp in play.)', 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable s long as defending player has a swamp in play.)', "Sylvan Yeti's power is equal to the number of cards in your hand.", "Take another turn after this one. You lose the game at the end of that turn. (You won't lose if you've won before the end of that turn.)", 'Tap all nonwhite creatures.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent draws a card.\\nYou gain 7 life.', "Target player can't attack on his or her next turn.", 'Target player chooses and discards two cards from his or her hand. (If that player has only one card, he or she discards it.)', 'Target player loses 4 life. You gain 4 life.', 'Target player takes another turn after this one.', "This turn, you may tap lands you don't control to help pay for your spells.", 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying. (This includes your creatures.)', 'U', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. You get another combat phase, followed by another main phase, this turn.', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'W', 'When Dakmor Ghoul comes into play, target opponent loses 2 life. You gain 2 life.', 'When Dakmor Lancer comes into play, destroy target nonblack creature.', "When Denizen of the Deep comes into play, return all other creatures you control from play to their owner's hand.", 'When Devout Monk comes into play, you gain 1 life.', 'When Goblin Commando comes into play, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Goblin General attacks, all Goblins you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Goblin Settler comes into play, destroy target land.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Loyal Sentry blocks, destroy it and the creature it blocks. (Destroy both creatures before dealing damage.)', "When Man-o'-War comes into play, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Ravenous Rats comes into play, target player chooses and discards a card from his or her hand.', 'When Royal Trooper blocks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play, you lose 3 life.', "When Sylvan Basilisk becomes blocked, destroy all creatures blocking it. (Destroy the creatures before they deal damage. Sylvan Basilisk still doesn't deal damage to defending player.)", 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves comes into play, search your library for a forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Hollow Dogs attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You gain 8 life.', "You may have Pride of Lions deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Thorn Elemental deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked."]
